ts prevalence and associated health risks.", "HÁBITOS ALIMENTARIOS:Hábitos Alimentarios refers to dietary practices that can influence the risk and management of diabetes.", "ACTIVIDAD FÍSICA:Actividad Física refers to physical activity, which is important for preventing and managing diabetes."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}